1. **What was failing**: The long options `--no-filename` and `--with-filename` were not being properly skipped when detecting the pattern index and iterating over file operands, causing them to be treated as filenames.

2. **What I changed**: Modified three loops in `src/new_grep/new_grep.c`:
   - Pattern detection loop (lines 173-194): Added check for long options before checking short option clusters
   - File counting loop (lines 204-228): Simplified to handle all options uniformly including long options  
   - Main file processing loop (lines 268-291): Added same option-skipping logic

3. **Build command**: `mkdir -p build && cc -std=c11 -Wall -Wextra -Werror -pedantic -O2 src/new_grep/new_grep.c -o build/new_grep`

